  m_Name: Bulgor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Rarety: 2
  m_Description: "A warlord of brutal might and volcanic fury, commanding an army
    by raw, undeniable power.\\nHis people are as crude and savage as the weapons
    they forge, but under his reign, they have become an unstoppable war machine\u2014driven
    by smoke, fire, and conquest.\\nDeeming the throne hollow, he vanished into the
    furnace-depths of his iron fortress. Beneath the smoke-choked skies, his forges
    burn, his warriors gather\u2014and the silence grows heavier with each passing
    day. "
